{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wand_mage","model_identifier":"wand_mage","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## wand_mage\n\nMage wand, Mage.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -0.8..0.8, z -10.0..2.8 (size 1.5 x 1.5 x 12.8 u = 4 x 4 x 36 cm).\nRank 4 of 6 (Mage). Mage wand: dark hardwood with a silver cap and prongs holding the gem, silver pommel. About 36 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n"},"description":"## wand_mage\n\nMage wand, Mage.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -0.8..0.8, z -10.0..2.8 (size 1.5 x 1.5 x 12.8 u = 4 x 4 x 36 cm).\nRank 4 of 6 (Mage). Mage wand: dark hardwood with a silver cap and prongs holding the gem, silver pommel. About 36 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"pommel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.6,-0.6,2.0],"to":[0.6,0.6,2.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4,0,5.2,1.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,0,28.75,1.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6,0,7.2,1.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[29,0,29.75,1.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[22,6,23.2,6.75],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[24,6,25.2,6.75],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"70b06dc3-758e-5205-b9f0-d54d9de07545"},{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.5,-1.5],"to":[0.5,0.5,2.0]